    "detailed_description": "<h1>Our games you might like</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1039370/extras/d765171bd0a198d770de9103e9d2cde6.avif?t=1733541565\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1039370/extras/c923d53e287e0b521092d61b2cc0bbd1.avif?t=1733541565\" /></div><br><br><strong>Take your brush and create your best work! Draw with friends or strangers! </strong><br><br>Draw With Unknown is a completely classic multiplayer drawing game. There is no precise goal, just draw what you think in your mind around by relaxing with the music playlist in play...<br><br><strong><i> &quot;Painting is the visible face of the iceberg of my thinking.&quot; Salvador Dali</i></strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1039370/extras/6d29552a7292e66ee5dc1e116da4465b.webp?t=1733541565\" /></div><br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br>\u25a0 Fun and relaxing game!<br>\u25a0 Multiplayer!<br>\u25a0 Different colors!<br>\u25a0 Different felt sizes!<br>\u25a0 Good music!",
